  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Given:<br /><br /><img height=\"93\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dee78490-64b0-4a61-b534-8092f801e7a4-image.png\" width=\"410\" /><br /><br />On the basis of data given above, predict which of the following gases shows the least adsorption on a definite amount of charcoal?</p>",
